{'symbol': 'WHR', 'date': '2022-09-21 08:30:00', 'title': 'WHIRLPOOL CORPORATION TO REACH 100 PERCENT RENEWABLE ELECTRICITY FOR U.S. PLANT OPERATIONS', 'text': 'BENTON HARBOR, MICH. , SEPT. 21, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- WHIRLPOOL CORP. (NYSE: WHR) ANNOUNCED THAT IT HAS ENTERED INTO A SECOND WIND VIRTUAL POWER PURCHASE AGREEMENT (VPPA) TO ACCELERATE PROGRESS TOWARDS ITS COMMITMENT TO REACH NET ZERO (SCOPES 1 AND 2) EMISSIONS IN ITS PLANTS AND OPERATIONS BY 2030.'}